abstract: >-
  Analysis of Sentinel-2 satellite imagery in QGIS: vegetation mapping with
  NDVI and flood mapping with false color composites and NDWI. This module was
  taught as part of the Purdue-NSF GIS Cybertraining for the Social Sciences
  Workshop, a two-day workshop held at Purdue University in 2026, to GIS
  professionals and instructors (Day 1, Session A QGIS track, part 3).
